<a href="#S2.p1.1" title="2 Related Works ‣ MMPhysVideo: Scaling Physical Plausibility in Video Generation via Joint Multimodal Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2</span></a>.
</span></li>
