<figure id="A2.F14" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2604.02817v1/evaluator_comparison.png" id="A2.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:537/80;" width="537" height="80" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span><span id="A2.F14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison</span> between VideoCon-Physics <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib84" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bansal et al., 2024</a>)</cite> and Videoscore2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib54" title="" class="ltx_ref">He et al., 2025</a>)</cite> evaluators.</figcaption>
</figure>
